  "description": "Como Demis Hassabis quer fiscalizar IA nos EUA? Quanto a Meta vai investir para levar o Hyperion a 5 GW? Quem é, de fato, \"Guardião do Estreito de Hormuz\"?",
  "body_html": "<p>Por: Guilherme Saboia e Vinicius Gushiken</p><h3>Demis Hassabis propõe órgão privado nos moldes da FINRA para fiscalizar a IA de fronteira</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Proposta.</strong> Em um <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-14/hassabis-propoe-orgao-de-padroes-para-ia-de-fronteira-nos-moldes-da-finra\">manifesto pessoal</a> intitulado “A Framework for Frontier AI and the Dawning of a New Age”, publicado na manhã de terça, Hassabis, Nobel de Química e chefe do Google DeepMind (criador do Gemini), defende um novo <em>Standards Body</em> (órgão de padrões) para fiscalizar a IA de fronteira nos EUA. Leia o post na íntegra <a href=\"https://demishassabis.substack.com/p/a-framework-for-frontier-ai-and-the-dawning-of-a-new-age\">aqui</a>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Modelo.</strong> O órgão seria inspirado na <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-14/hassabis-propoe-orgao-de-padroes-para-ia-de-fronteira-nos-moldes-da-finra\">FINRA</a>, o fiscalizador privado e financiado pela indústria que regula Wall Street sob supervisão da SEC (a reguladora do mercado de capitais dos EUA), e seria bancado majoritariamente pelos próprios laboratórios que fiscaliza.</p></li><li><p><strong>Testes.</strong> Os laboratórios compartilhariam seus modelos de forma voluntária, até 30 dias antes do lançamento, para <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-14/hassabis-propoe-orgao-de-padroes-para-ia-de-fronteira-nos-moldes-da-finra\">testes de capacidades perigosas</a> nas áreas cibernética, biológica e de manipulação (<em>deception</em>); as regras valeriam para todos os modelos de classe fronteira, abertos ou fechados e de qualquer país.</p></li><li><p><strong>Poder.</strong> A participação começa voluntária, mas, uma vez que o processo se mostre confiável, passar pelo <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-14/hassabis-propoe-orgao-de-padroes-para-ia-de-fronteira-nos-moldes-da-finra\">Standards Body</a> poderia virar requisito para lançar no mercado dos EUA.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"346.9375\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1281,&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:520,&quot;bytes&quot;:204743,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Demis Hassabis, CEO da Google DeepMind&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Demis Hassabis, CEO da Google DeepMind\" title=\"Demis Hassabis, CEO da Google DeepMind\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8iXR!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F551486c3-bc9b-4d5e-8bda-a582e3ad8158_1920x1281.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Demis Hassabis, CEO da Google DeepMind e laureado com o Nobel de Química. Imagem: John Sears / Wikimedia Commons (CC BY-SA 4.0)</figcaption></figure></div><h3>Meta amplia o campus Hyperion para 5 GW com investimento acima de US$50 bilhões</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Expansão.</strong> A Meta anunciou na segunda que vai ampliar o <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/meta-investe-us-40-bilhoes-adicionais-em-data-center-na-louisiana\">campus Hyperion</a>, em Richland Parish, Louisiana, para 5 GW de capacidade computacional, bem acima do plano original de 2025, firmado via joint venture com a Blue Owl Capital e orçado em cerca de US$27 bilhões; a primeira fase segue no cronograma para entregar cerca de 2 GW até 2030.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cifra.</strong> A obra em si exige <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/meta-investe-us-40-bilhoes-adicionais-em-data-center-na-louisiana\">mais de US$50 bilhões</a> (sem contar os chips). Somando os processadores e itens relacionados, o custo total do campus chega a cerca de US$250 bilhões, segundo a Bloomberg.</p></li><li><p><strong>Energia.</strong> O Hyperion será alimentado por 10 novas usinas (sete delas de gás natural) da concessionária Entergy, mais 1,5 GW de geração e armazenamento solar e mais de 160 km de linhas de transmissão; a Meta diz que o acordo de energia economizará mais de US$2 bilhões aos clientes da Entergy Louisiana em 20 anos e que arcará com os custos de energia, água e infraestrutura.</p></li><li><p><strong>Chip.</strong> O <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/meta-investe-us-40-bilhoes-adicionais-em-data-center-na-louisiana\">MTI 500</a>, o acelerador de IA mais avançado da Meta, entrega 30 petaflops no formato MX4 (padrão de baixa precisão para IA), o dobro da velocidade do MTI 400, consumindo cerca de 40% mais eletricidade.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"292.64444444444445\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1013,&quot;width&quot;:1800,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:520,&quot;bytes&quot;:605233,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Obras do campus de data centers Hyperion, da Meta, em Louisiana&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Obras do campus de data centers Hyperion, da Meta, em Louisiana\" title=\"Obras do campus de data centers Hyperion, da Meta, em Louisiana\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CSZV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2cc35ccd-0c6f-4bae-99fc-4217d1e696cc_1800x1013.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Obras do campus Hyperion, da Meta, em Richland Parish, Louisiana. Imagem: Meta</figcaption></figure></div><h3>Trump reimpõe bloqueio naval ao Irã e cria taxa de 20% no Estreito de Ormuz</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Bloqueio.</strong> Trump <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/tensoes-entre-eua-e-ira-e-agenda-economica-marcam-segunda-feira\">reinstaurou o bloqueio naval dos EUA</a> à navegação iraniana na segunda-feira e declarou que toda carga não iraniana que cruzar o Estreito de Ormuz deve pagar aos EUA uma taxa de 20%; o bloqueio começaria às 20h00 GMT de terça. O chanceler iraniano Abbas Araghchi ridicularizou a taxa, chamando o Irã de “guardião” do estreito.</p></li><li><p><strong>Acordo desfeito.</strong> A medida elimina a última concessão do <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-13/tensoes-entre-eua-e-ira-e-agenda-economica-marcam-segunda-feira\">memorando de junho assinado em Versalhes</a>, apenas 26 dias antes, desfazendo o acordo de paz preliminar; Trump notificou o Congresso de que a ação militar dos EUA contra o Irã “começou em 7 de julho”.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K_4l!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7c8b86c1-ead6-4c70-9b25-4cc6f9a4ef3a_1600x900.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K_4l!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7c8b86c1-ead6-4c70-9b25-4cc6f9a4ef3a_1600x900.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K_4l!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7c8b86c1-ead6-4c70-9b25-4cc6f9a4ef3a_1600x900.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K_4l!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7c8b86c1-ead6-4c70-9b25-4cc6f9a4ef3a_1600x900.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K_4l!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,