,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7c8b86c1-ead6-4c70-9b25-4cc6f9a4ef3a_1600x900.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Navios navegam perto do Estreito de Ormuz, na costa dos Emirados Árabes, em Khor Fakkan. Imagem: AFP via Getty Images</figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><blockquote><p><strong>Abaixo, apenas para assinantes:</strong></p><p><strong>Chips.</strong> Uma gigante de semicondutores restringe quais clientes asiáticos podem comprar seus chips de IA, para conter desvios à China.</p><p><strong>Data centers.</strong> Um estado dos EUA vira o primeiro a decretar moratória para novos data centers.</p><p><strong>Energia.</strong> Uma big tech fecha acordo para bancar toda a produção inicial de um grande projeto solar.</p><p><strong>Robótica.</strong> Novas apostas em humanoides na Ásia, de uma rodada pré-IPO chinesa a um acordo de produção em massa no Japão.</p><p><strong>Capital.</strong> Novas rodadas em startups de IA, de um laboratório de modelos chinês a uma empresa de geração de vídeo apoiada pela Alibaba.</p><p><strong>Mercados.</strong> Ações de uma gigante de tecnologia despencam após alerta de receita trimestral abaixo do esperado.</p><p><strong>Macro.</strong> Um diretor do Fed sinaliza que os juros nos EUA podem subir no curto prazo.</p><p><strong>Defesa.</strong> Um grupo de países europeus forma uma coalizão de defesa antimísseis.</p><p><strong>Geopolítica.</strong> Rebeldes iemenitas atacam um aeroporto saudita no maior confronto com Riade em anos.</p></blockquote><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://abacatepay.com\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png\" width=\"4700\" height=\"649\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:649,&quot;width&quot;:4700,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:86036,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;AbacatePay&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://abacatepay.com&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"AbacatePay\" title=\"AbacatePay\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><h4>Chips e exportações</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Nvidia.</strong> <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-14/nvidia-reduz-lista-de-clientes-na-asia-para-cumprir-sancoes-dos-eua\">Cortou em mais da metade</a> o número de clientes asiáticos autorizados a comprar seus chips de IA, após criar uma <em>white list</em> (lista branca) com verificações de conformidade mais rígidas para barrar desvios à China. Intensificou a diligência em Singapura, Malásia e Japão e passou a visitar data centers, checar contratos e entrevistar usuários finais, após a orientação do BIS (<em>Bureau of Industry and Security</em>, o órgão de controle de exportações do Departamento de Comércio dos EUA) de 31 de maio.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g2Yo!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbc42e5a-740b-4204-9f67-a26ec75663c9_1920x1080.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g2Yo!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbc42e5a-740b-4204-9f67-a26ec75663c9_1920x1080.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g2Yo!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbc42e5a-740b-4204-9f67-a26ec75663c9_1920x1080.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!g2Yo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressi